<title>USA: Ameristar Casinos Inc Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Ameristar Casinos Inc Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(amounts in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>						  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							Mar. 31,</p>
<p>					 1997			   1996</p>
<p> Gross revenues		  $53,412			$45,333</p>
<p>Less: Promotional allowances</p>
<p>				     (3,799)			(2,427)</p>
<p>   Net revenues		   49,613			 42,906</p>
<p>Operating income (expense):</p>
<p>   Jackpot Properties	    2,222			  1,772</p>
<p>   Ameristar Vicksburg	   2,916			  3,199</p>
<p>   Ameristar Council Bluffs    4,062			  3,390</p>
<p>   Corporate (A)		 (5,215)			(3,412)</p>
<p>   Preopening (B)		     --			(5,856)</p>
<p>Income (loss) before income</p>
<p>  taxes				3,985			  (907)</p>
<p>Income tax provision (benefit)</p>
<p>					 1,475			  (335)</p>
<p> Net income (loss) (C)	   2,510			  (572)</p>
<p> Earnings per share (C)	   0.12			 (0.03)</p>
<p> Shares outstanding	     20,360			 20,360</p>
<p>(A) Corporate operating expense includes interest expense, business development costs and general corporate overhead.</p>
<p>(B) Preopening costs relate to the company's Ameristar Casino Council Bluffs project and include an aggregate of $1.0 million in contributions to six charitable organizations in Iowa.</p>
<p>(C) Net income before preopening costs of $5.9 million on a pretax basis related to Ameristar Council Bluffs (which opened on January 19, 1996) was $3.1 million for the three months ended March 31, 1996.  Earnings per share before preopening costs was $0.15 for the same period.</p>
